      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I wasn't happy with 1 of your suppliers as I found out he told me a untruth after his visit.  He asked me which solar panels and inverters others had provided quotes for and when I openly told him he discredited one of the solar panel brands as he had never heard of them before plus he then went on to tell me that mono was better than poly (I can't remember which he said was better but after reading your website after our meeting your website clearly stated this was incorrect and that both are as good as each other).  He did appear to be very much a salesman and when I read up about the differences in solar panels (ie mono vs poly) I didn't follow-up with him as was immediately turned off (this was with Termico).I was happy with the other 2 companies you referred but they could not compete with the price quoted by Synergy.  I am hoping I have no problems with the installation next week...I am happy to be contacted for further info by you but do not wish to have my feedback included on the web right now.",
