      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I was happy with the initial responses from the 2 suppliers Infinite Energy and Green Logic that contacted me through solarquotes.  I had also contacted Synergy who is my electricity service provider in WA and who is also offering a solar installation service.  From the extensive research I did on the SolarQuotes website and other sources into various types of solar panels, the quality panel option they offered was the one I went for.  Although a slightly more expensive option than the options for comparable panels quoted by the other SolarQuotes recommended installers, I eventually settled on their option.  I did get back in touch with one of the other installers and requested if they could quote on the installation of the same panel as the Synergy option, however their quote on this came in higher than Synergy.A further advantage I felt by going with the Synergy offer was that they handled all aspects of the process from the application to Western Power (the power provider) for connection to checking eligibility for buyback rates, as well as my existing electricity account being set up ready.  Being an energy service company, they already have an established customer service reputation and indicated they will be around for some time to come and take care of any future equipment warranty/maintenance issues without me as a customer having to contact individual component suppliers.",
